# The Galaxy Book4 Edge keyboard (ENE 0CF2:9050 on i2c-hid) also reports BTN_0/BTN_1 and ABS_VOLUME,
# so udev's input_id classifies it as a tablet pad and libinput never treats it as a keyboard.
# libinput also reads the tags of the parent inputN device, so clear them there too.
ACTION!="remove", SUBSYSTEM=="input", ATTRS{name}=="hid-over-i2c 0CF2:9050 Keyboard", \
  ENV{ID_INPUT_TABLET}="", ENV{ID_INPUT_TABLET_PAD}=""
